      },
      "content": "Requirements",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1290",
      "reading_order": 1637,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 775.6260195312501,
        "r": 265.743,
        "b": 767.5383344167462
      },
      "content": "Check that the following requirements have been met:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1291",
      "reading_order": 1638,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00000000000003,
        "t": 760.50601953125,
        "r": 548.811,
        "b": 739.3413344167462
      },
      "content": " The appliance has been disconnected from the power supply and protective measures have been taken to ensure the power cannot be switched on again."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1292",
      "reading_order": 1639,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99099999999993,
        "t": 735.07201953125,
        "r": 163.60199999999992,
        "b": 726.6243344167463
      },
      "content": " The appliance is cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1293",
      "reading_order": 1640,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.981999999999914,
        "t": 722.2290195312501,
        "r": 239.30999999999995,
        "b": 713.7813344167463
      },
      "content": " The casing of the appliance is removed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1294",
      "reading_order": 1641,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.972999999999956,
        "t": 709.3860195312501,
        "r": 363.97799999999995,
        "b": 700.9383344167463
      },
      "content": " The high voltage capacitors are discharged before commencing work."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1295",
      "reading_order": 1642,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 676.96801953125,
        "r": 252.95999999999998,
        "b": 666.1844393785782
      },
      "content": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0294",
      "reading_order": 1643,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.022453660871285,
        "t": 663.0005107209759,
        "r": 230.12331567074665,
        "b": 547.8894990631518
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0294.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_1295",
      "next_block_id": "txt_1296"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0295",
      "reading_order": 1644,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 243.1012491672887,
        "t": 663.3980656075307,
        "r": 357.36487255243884,
        "b": 548.5994827717118
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0295.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_1295",
      "next_block_id": "txt_1296"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1296",
      "reading_order": 1645,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 541.98591953125,
        "r": 319.37399999999997,
        "b": 533.8982344167462
      },
      "content": "Unplug all the electrical connections on the transformer(s)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1297",
      "reading_order": 1646,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.990999999999985,
        "t": 529.26891953125,
        "r": 499.491,
        "b": 508.33823441674616
      },
      "content": "Disconnect the transformer(s) from the magnetron(s) by unplugging the orange filament cables at the magnetron(s)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1298",
      "reading_order": 1647,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.991,
        "t": 503.34891953125,
        "r": 320.70599999999996,
        "b": 495.26123441674616
      },
      "content": "Unfasten the four M5 flange nuts to remove a transformer."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1299",
      "reading_order": 1648,
      "section": "Removing a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00899999999996,
        "t": 490.74891953124995,
        "r": 553.149,
        "b": 469.8182344167461
      },
      "content": "On the X12 high power variants, the rear HV transformer should be removed first to gain access for removal of the front HV transformer."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1300",
      "reading_order": 1649,
      "section": "Fitting a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 445.96801953125,
        "r": 232.2,
        "b": 435.18443937857825
      },
      "content": "Fitting a transformer (high voltage)",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1301",
      "reading_order": 1650,
      "section": "Fitting a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 427.38601953125,
        "r": 347.06699999999995,
        "b": 419.2983344167462
      },
      "content": "Follow the steps in the reverse order to fit the high voltage transformer(s)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1302",
      "reading_order": 1651,
      "section": "Fitting a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 44.00999999999999,
        "t": 412.38301953125,
        "r": 274.71869999999984,
        "b": 403.9353344167462
      },
      "content": " The fixing nuts should be torqued down to 3.5Nm."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1303",
      "reading_order": 1652,
      "section": "Fitting a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 44.01899999999995,
        "t": 399.54001953125,
        "r": 541.3589999999999,
        "b": 378.49233441674613
      },
      "content": " On the X12 high power variants, the HV transformer connections on the front HV transformer are on the left-hand side. The connections of the rear HV transformer are on the right-hand side (looking from the front)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1304",
      "reading_order": 1653,
      "section": "Fitting a transformer (high voltage)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 44.00999999999999,
        "t": 374.09701953124994,
        "r": 383.54400000000004,
        "b": 365.6493344167461
      },
      "content": " Ensure the wiring is fixed back in the original orientation with new cable ties."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1305",
      "reading_order": 1654,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 342.90601953125,
        "r": 74.34,
        "b": 334.7187304760583
      },
      "content": "NOTICE:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1306",
      "reading_order": 1655,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 327.54301953125,
        "r": 532.143,
        "b": 306.6123344167462
      },
      "content": "It is imperative that the electrical connections are replaced correctly. If the electric connections have not been  restored properly this may lead to malfunction/damage of the oven."
    },
